# Site Theme Tokens

Member-app UI look is owned by **`src/index.css`** (`.site-*` classes). Catalog/constants: **`src/lib/siteTheme.ts`**.

When adding or restyling controls, **use theme tokens** — do not invent one-off `bg-slate-800 border-slate-600` chrome.

## Do not theme (yet)

- Prerender / SEO landing (`PublicSeoLanding` and related) — handled separately
- Specialty accents with meaning (UEX sky, reputation colors, mining rarity)

## Control → token map

| Control | Class |
|---|---|
| Text / select | `site-input` (+ `px-3 py-2` as needed) |
| Textarea | `site-textarea` |
| Label / hint / error | `site-label` / `site-hint` / `site-error-text` |
| Primary CTA | `site-btn-primary` |
| Secondary | `site-btn-secondary` |
| Danger / success | `site-btn-danger` / `site-btn-success` |
| Accent / ghost / icon | `site-btn-accent` / `site-btn-ghost` / `site-btn-icon` |
| Header chrome chip | `site-chrome-control` |
| Panel / card | `site-surface` / `site-card` |
| Section block | `site-section` + `site-section-header` + `site-section-body` |
| Chip strip | `site-chip-strip` |
| Idle / selected filter | `site-filter-idle` / `site-filter-selected-*` |
| Checkbox / radio / range | `site-checkbox` / `site-radio` / `site-range` |
| Toggle | `site-toggle` + `data-on="true\|false"` |
| Dropdown list | `site-dropdown-list` + `site-dropdown-item` |
| Menu / modal | `site-menu-panel` / `site-menu-item` (+ `-active` / `-locked`) / `site-modal-shell` / `site-modal-backdrop` |
| Menu section header | `site-menu-section` |
| Divider | `site-divider` |
| Table | `site-table-wrap` + `site-table` |
| Banner / badge | `site-banner-*` / `site-badge-*` |
| Empty state | `site-empty` |
| Tooltip | `site-tooltip-panel` (via `SiteTooltip`) |

Optional hover shimmer: add `site-btn-shimmer`.

## Changing the look later

Edit **only** `src/index.css` token definitions. Call sites should keep using the same class names.

Bulk helper (safe recipes): `node scripts/migrate-site-theme.mjs` (dry-run) / `--write`.
